    },
    "同步已在别的设备上重置。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sync was reset on another device."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "同步已在别的设备上重置。输入现在的同步密码重新加入，这台设备上的数据会和其他设备的合并。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sync was reset on another device. Enter its sync password to rejoin; what’s on this device is merged with the other devices’."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "同步已在别的设备上重置，重新加入后继续同步。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sync was reset on another device. Rejoin it to keep syncing."
          }
        }
      }
    },
