    "在几台设备之间同步数据，数据使用端到端加密（E2EE）：离开这台设备前就已加密，远端只有密文，只有拥有密码的设备能解开。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sync your data between devices, end-to-end encrypted (E2EE): it’s encrypted before it leaves this device, so remote storage holds only ciphertext, and only devices with the password can read it."
          }
        }
      }
    },
